[Music]  here we go again sony has once again  revealed the free games for ps plus  subscribers for the month of december  2021 as per usual you can grab all these  games from the first tuesday of the  month which this time is all the way  over on december the 7th  first up on the ps5 is good fall a  visually striking yet kind of mundane  hack and slash adventure if you like  collecting loot you will like godfall  which also supports three-player  cooperative play without a doubt the  best element of godfall is the combat  with countless weapons to master  including a hammer a broadsword and even  dual blades there is some finesse to  each weapon such as using heavy attacks  to fill up a stagger gauge to knock back  your enemy and another system which  buffs your secondary weapon over time  pushing you to switch your play style  and use other weapon types the problem  was when this game released button  bashing could pretty much get you just  as far as being a skilled fighter but  that was over a year ago now the story  sees us fill the boots of a king in  exile who must hunt down his own brother  who wants to be a god that loot we  mentioned becomes a thing you'll chase  when the story dies down and there's  tons of it including 12 sets of top tier  armor which buffs your play styles in  different ways if you are a  completionist gamer godfall ticks so  many boxes but you must also expect to  play the same missions over and over and  over again next up we have mortal shell  if you like from soft games like dark  souls sekuro and bloodborne you'll very  much enjoy mortal shell but also if  you've ever been intrigued to play dark  souls but was a bit put off by how  difficult it was then mortal shell is  the perfect starting point and that is  simply because it's less difficult and  far more forgiving we have fast light  attacks strong but slow heavy attacks  and a very forgiving dodge mortal shell  also has a hardened ability which turns  your character into stone so you can  tank a shot from the enemy this one  ability turns excruciatingly tough boss  fights into a much easier affair but by  lowering that skill ceiling mortal shell  never feels as monumental as the games  it's based upon we play as a being who  cannot survive in this world and must  find a corpse to resurrect hence the  name mortal shell there are four shells  to discover all warriors with immense  fighting abilities that change your play  style so will you give mortal shell a  try and finally a much less punishing  game lego dc super villains the first  thing of note here is that the story is  surprisingly good and i mean it the  justice league has vanished leaving  behind a group of imposters known as the  justice syndicate and they're all voiced  by really talented actors lego dc super  villains lets us design and become our  own super villain upgrading our powers  as we progress through the story or if  you don't fancy being original you can  play as pretty much any dc super villain  that comes to mind all of this is in a  fully open world with countless easter  eggs and references to the dc world and  many standout locations to visit too  like metropolis and gotham lego dc super  villains is totally a kid's game but  nobody has to know that you're an adult  play what you like and on top of all  this remember there are three more psvr  games which you can still get for  another month and did you know one of  those the persistence can be played  without psvr so add it to your library  if you haven't already so that's our jam  for the month of december 2021 what are  your thoughts please review the  offerings in the comments below i'm adam  you're awesome merry chrysler  [Music]  you

